    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA superb opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached residence extending to approximately 115 sq.m., ideally suited to first-time buyers, families or those seeking a stylish turnkey home.\n\nThis impressive property has been finished to a high standard throughout and is presented in excellent condition, allowing the new owner to move in with ease and comfort. The accommodation is bright, spacious and thoughtfully laid out, comprising a welcoming entrance hall, an elegant living room, a modern kitchen/dining area with ample space for everyday family living and entertaining, together with a convenient guest WC on the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a generous master bedroom with ensuite, along with a contemporary family bathroom. The attic has been floored, providing excellent additional storage space and enhancing the practicality of the home.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front, while the rear garden is fully enclosed, offering a safe and private outdoor space ideal for children, pets or outdoor dining. Side access adds further convenience.\n\nCombining quality finishes, spacious accommodation and a low-maintenance setting, this attractive home is ready for immediate occupation and is sure to appeal to a wide range of discerning purchasers\n\nLeitrim Village is a charming and picturesque village located in County Leitrim, nestled on the banks of the River Shannon and just a short distance from Carrick-on-Shannon. Renowned for its peaceful setting and strong sense of community, the village offers an excellent balance of rural tranquillity and convenient access to a wide range of amenities."
      },
